  "adaptation": [
    "Standalone expf and shared table/config/error helpers; symbols namespaced; exported __wrap_expf.",
    "Fixed upstream tablebits5/TOINT_INTRINSICS0 configuration; errno/test/glibc alias glue omitted.",
    "Algorithm, coefficient/table literals and arithmetic expression ordering retained.",
    "Existing portable_trig.c uses the same pinned upstream commit.",
    "Float32/float64 IEEE formats, no excess precision, round-to-nearest ties-even, no contraction/fastmath; errno and exception flags unclaimed.",
    "portable_neural_f32 additionally selects pinned Arm powf and OpenLibm tanhf/private expm1f.",
    "Support symbols are namespaced; public ABI wrappers are __wrap_powf and __wrap_tanhf.",
    "OpenLibm signed exponent shifts use unsigned words; all original arithmetic/coefficient ordering is retained."
  ],
